:{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T15:24:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T15:36:52Z","body":"You can check the name and adjust the error message here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp#L1626-L1629","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526180152/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526269747","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526269747","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526269747,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wk9Ez","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T17:16:44Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T17:16:44Z","body":"I gotta say, going as far as making these annotations actually supported, documented and overall entirely valid, only to then consider them errors is a very unsatisfying way to go about this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526269747/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526309251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526309251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526309251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlGuD","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T18:28:18Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T18:28:18Z","body":"Note that `@deprecated`, `@experimental`, and `@tutorial` are not annotations, but doc comment tags. They just both use the same symbol `@`. See [GDScript documentation comments](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html).\r\n\r\n`@deprecated` and `@experimental` are implemented as doc comment tags, because they are part of the documentation system and use the same BBCode markup as descriptions. There is no way to declare an API deprecated/experimental \"fundamentally\", through core systems like `ClassDB`, `Object`, `Script`. In the engine and extensions we just edit XML files. So I think it makes sense for GDScript to have it just as part of doc comments, not at the language level.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526309251/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526312809","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526312809","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526312809,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlHlp","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T18:33:07Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T18:33:07Z","body":"You may say as such, but from the user's perspective this still remains a somewhat perplexing decision.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526312809/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526321070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526321070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526321070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlJmu","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T18:45:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T18:45:22Z","body":"Would you prefer the following?\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@description(\"\"\"\r\nDo something for this plugin. Before using the method\r\nyou first have to [method initialize] [MyPlugin].[br]\r\n[color=yellow]Warning:[/color] Always [method clean] after use.[br]\r\nUsage:\r\n[codeblock]\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    the_plugin.initialize()\r\n    the_plugin.do_something()\r\n    the_plugin.clean()\r\n[/codeblock]\r\n\"\"\")\r\n@deprecated(\"Use [method other] instead.\")\r\nfunc do_something():\r\n    pass\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526321070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526321997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526321997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526321997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlJ1N","user":{"login":"JoNax97","id":10124534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTI0NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10124534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97","html_url":"https://github.com/JoNax97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoNax97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T18:46:54Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T18:48:22Z","body":"Im not sure about the description one, but I prefer it for the deprecated and experimental ones. \r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, having actual annotations that are backed by classDB would open the door for supporting the deprecated and experimental tags in C# right? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526321997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526337726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526337726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526337726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlNq-","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T19:10:51Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T19:10:51Z","body":"1. Deprecated/experimental use the same markup as description. If we add BBCodes highlighting to doc comments, it will automatically work for deprecated/experimental as well.\r\n2. Annotations support constant expressions. Using comments, we simplify support for third-party tools, since writing a third-party parser for GDScript is much easier than an analyzer can fold constants and resolve dependencies.\r\n3. Declaring a class member deprecated/experimental does nothing at the language level, it doesn't even produce warnings like in C#. And we don't have a foundation for this, the same in the core. Deprecated/experimental is just metadata, just like the description.\r\n4. Doc comment tags in GDScript resemble [Javadoc](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Javadoc) tags.\r\n\r\n> Also, having actual annotations that are backed by classDB would open the door for supporting the deprecated and experimental tags in C# right?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean, but it could be:\r\n\r\n* #88730\r\n* #83505\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526337726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526558729","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2526558729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2526558729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WmDoJ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T00:46:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T00:46:59Z","body":"> You can check the name and adjust the error message here:\r\n\r\nThis would make the implementation smaller, but the downside is that they won't appear in the class reference anymore. That said, it may be preferable to create a pseudo-class (like `@GlobalScope`) to document GDScript documentation comments specifically, e.g. `@GDScriptComments`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526558729/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527674174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2527674174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2527674174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WqT8-","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T11:35:54Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T11:41:10Z","body":"I don't like the idea of reserving a name with no proper implementation. If custom annotations became a thing, this API should be removed immediately to allow these otherwise valid names to be usable. \r\nWe also don't do this for \"common synonyms in APIs\" like has/contains/includes (besides for array push_back and append I suppose)...\r\n\r\nDocumenting other things in the class ref sounds great, I've made a proposal for this as well. I'd prefer it to be less hacky and better integrated with the rest of the docs, but I see no clear solution for implementation here.\r\n\r\nOr simply hard-coding the error message to substitute the generic \"annotation not found\" error just for these specific annotation names, without registering them as annotations.\r\n\r\n> the downside is that they won't appear in the class reference anymore\r\n\r\nRightfully so, since they *aren't* annotations! There's a docs page explaining gdscript doc comments syntax, that's the only place it makes sense to document this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527674174/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527696478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2527696478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2527696478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WqZZe","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T11:46:51Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T11:49:30Z","body":"> Declaring a class member deprecated/experimental does nothing at the language level, it doesn't even produce warnings like in C#. And we don't have a foundation for this, the same in the core. Deprecated/experimental is just metadata, just like the description.\r\n\r\nThat's outside the scope of this PR, but IMO we should add support for deprecated/experimental at the ClassDB and language level. In my understanding, this was the plan all along but we merged the quick-and-dirty \"edit the XML\" approach first, and that ended up being permanent.\r\n\r\nIdeally we'd support `ClassDB::bind_deprecated_method` or `ClassDB::set_method_deprecated` etc. and make proper use of this information:\r\n- To add the flag and deprecation message in the XML.\r\n- To flag deprecated methods as such in the autocompletion.\r\n- To generate warnings that help users port their code to non-deprecated methods.\r\n- Possibly to remove them from the API if `#ifdef DISABLE_DEPRECATED`.\r\n\r\nAFAIR we already set this info in ClassDB when parsing the class ref, but this is just backwards. We should add a way to register this in ClassDB when registering the methods.\r\n\r\nIf we do this, then adding the annotations to GDScript would make sense too.\r\n\r\nUntil then, I tend to agree with RedMser that just hardcoding a check for those two in the error message for unknown annotations might be better than creating ineffective annotations.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527696478/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527839427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2527839427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2527839427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wq8TD","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T12:49:34Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T12:49:34Z","body":"To be honest, I didn't even think that someone would try to use unknown keywords/annotations. Usually, if I don't know if a language has a feature, I open the documentation or a search engine, rather than trying to use a random construct.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, checking for non-existent things should only be done if it's a common and frequent mistake, or if the user might be confused by autocomplete, etc. Yes, we have a check for the C-style ternary operator. But I'm curious how often users try to use the operator without reading the docs. Would users draw a different conclusion if they got a generic \"Invalid token\" error instead of a dedicated message?\r\n\r\nBuilt-in help lacks many things that the online documentation has (shader reference, `RichTextLabel` BBCodes, `Expression` operators, GDScript keywords, etc.). If we want to include this in the built-in help, we should create pseudo-pages (like `@ShaderReference`) and/or add support for [custom sections](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/11276#discussioncomment-11444476) in existing doc pages.\r\n\r\nRegarding `@deprecated` and `@experimental` annotations, I think the current consensus is that we shouldn't register non-existent annotations solely for the purpose of documenting doc comment tags, especially in an unrelated section. Maybe in the future we'll upgrade the level of support for deprecated/experimental information and actual annotations will make sense, as akien-mga said.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2527839427/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528276105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2528276105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2528276105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wsm6J","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T15:08:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T15:09:06Z","body":"I've pushed a commit that removes the annotation registrations and modifies the \"unknown annotation\" message instead.\r\n\r\nNote that this means multiple `@deprecated` or `@experimental` invalid annotation uses will no longer show multiple errors, but only a single error for the first occurrence of the invalid annotation. This is also an issue with the original \"unknown annotation\" message which should probably highlight all error instances too.\r\n\r\n> To be honest, I didn't even think that someone would try to use unknown keywords/annotations. Usually, if I don't know if a language has a feature, I open the documentation or a search engine, rather than trying to use a random construct.\r\n\r\nI tried to use `@deprecated` in a script a few weeks ago :slightly_smiling_face: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528276105/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529137864","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2529137864","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2529137864,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wv5TI","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T19:10:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T19:10:16Z","body":"The commit message/PR title should be adjusted since it's no longer adding annotations.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529137864/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537424518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100174#issuecomment-2537424518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100174","id":2537424518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XPgaG","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T23:41:29Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T23:41:29Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537424518/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]